次用餐的整體體驗沒有符合我的期待。\n\n麵條的部分比較接近不夠 Q 的烏龍麵口感，但又不像真正的烏龍麵，更不像一般拉麵應有的彈性與嚼勁。以店家主打拉麵來說，麵體表現讓我有些失望。\n\n湯頭部分香油比例偏高，入口後香油味較為明顯，反而掩蓋了湯底本身的風味層次，不太符合我的口味。\n\n我點的餐點價格一碗 299元，另外還需加收服務費。就我此次用餐的感受而言，服務內容主要是協助倒第一杯水，後續並沒有感受到與服務費相對應的服務品質，因此整體的價格與體驗落差較大。\n\n以上僅代表個人用餐感受，提供給其他準備前往用餐的消費者參考。",null,[0,89]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvYkZOSGVIbFRiRUp2VWpGVmVsSXhRVEJqU0VFMFVWYzFiRkp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvYkZOSGVIbFRiRUp2VWpGVmVsSXhRVEJqU0VFMFVWYzFiRkp1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvYkZOSGVIbFRiRUp2VWpGVmVsSXhRVEJqU0VFMFVWYzFiRkp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvYkZOSGVIbFRiRUp2VWpGVmVsSXhRVEJqU0VFMFVWYzFiRkp1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvYkZOSGVIbFRiRUp2VWpGVmVsSXhRVEJqU0VFMFVWYzFiRkp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12133982543605856493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvYkZOSGVIbFRiRUp2VWpGVmVsSXhRVEJqU0VFMFVWYzFiRkp1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,340,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21obFNHeHlTbEJvUjFVelIxQTBjSEE0UVc1bFJuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb8c3298b04fcfde7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmhlSGxySlBoR1UzR1A0cHA4QW5lRnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21obFNHeHlTbEJvUjFVelIxQTBjSEE0UVc1bFJuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21obFNHeHlTbEJvUjFVelIxQTBjSEE0UVc1bFJuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21obFNHeHlTbEJvUjFVel